---
description: Spec-driven development — constitution, specs/ tree, no invented syntax
alwaysApply: true
---

Engineering source of truth is `specs/` (constitution, `specs/global/`, active `specs/features/NNN-slug/`). Process: `specs/README.md`. Index: `specs/STATUS.md`.

Do not invent language syntax or features. Do not infer unspecified behavior from code alone. Ask if a spec is missing.

PRs that change language or user-visible behavior must link `spec.md` (and `plan.md` / `tasks.md` for feature work).
